  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Decentralisation and Municipal Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DEMOS II is an intervention that addresses the following root causes/problems of bad governance,dissatisfied citizens, lack of downwards accountability, clientelism, low civil service performance, etc. Central to the project is the Performance Grant (PG), which provides performance-based non-earmarked grants to municipalities. The overall goal of the PG is to incentivise municipalities to improve governance processes at the local level which will lead to provision of better services to citizens.</narrative>
  </description>
